# Source citation format

Use in compliance reports, search reports, gap cards, and agent outputs.

## Inline citation

```
[source: `<relative-path>` § <section-or-line> — "<short quote>"]
```

Example:

```
[source: `docs/01-intake/specification.md` § 4.2 — "Срок сдачи этапа 1 — 30.06.2026"]
```

## Report footer block

End analytical reports with:

```markdown
## Sources consulted
| # | Path | Section | Used for |
|---|------|---------|----------|
| 1 | docs/... | ... | ... |
```

## Unverified block

```markdown
## Requires confirmation
- <claim> — no matching source found in repository search
```

## Metrics

For eval, count citations with valid existing paths as **cited**; claims without citation as **uncited**.
